{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-heartwarming-hugs-bear-2-with-zipper-closure-2605-0036","content_id":"703553fe-3d16-4dc5-a63b-1fa43eab3e41","description":"Product Recall for Heartwarming Hugs Bear 2 with Zipper Closure presenting a risk of choking. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"fd3a5043-9fa9-445e-87d8-75c1dea4a495","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-11T15:48:27+01:00","id":"fd3a5043-9fa9-445e-87d8-75c1dea4a495","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:48:27+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a01ec3b4fb0713aa63ea729/2605-0036-product-recall-heartwarming-hugs-bear.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Heartwarming Hugs Bear 2 with Zipper Closure</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of choking as it has been identified that the zipper on the bear’s pouch can detach, creating a small part.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Build-A-Bear.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Dolls/Soft Toys (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Build-A-Bear</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>434464</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>21st January – 6th March 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Brown weighted plush bear with a zipped pouch. Inside the pouch is a heart filled with ceramic beads, which can be heated or cooled.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_fd3a5043-9fa9-445e-87d8-75c1dea4a495\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a01ec3b4fb0713aa63ea729/2605-0036-product-recall-heartwarming-hugs-bear.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of choking as it has been identified that the zipper on the bear’s pouch can detach, creating a small part.</p>\n\n<p>This poses a choking hazard to young children, who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Build-A-Bear.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers are advised to stop using the product immediately and return it to their local Build-A-Bear store for a refund. For more information please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.buildabear.co.uk/brand-about-safety-recalls.html\">Product Safety Recalls</a>, call 0800 037 9782, or email <a href=\"mailto:ProductHotline@buildabear.com\">ProductHotline@buildabear.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0036</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-11T14:49:28Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-11","product_risk_level":"low"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product